# IT 140 Module Four Assignment
# Higher/Lower Game Pseudocode Template
#
# Complete the TODO prompts below with your own pseudocode.
# Keep this file in .pseudo format for submission.
#
# Use clear indentation to show decisions and repeated behavior.
# Your finished pseudocode should address every requirement in the
# current Module Four Assignment Guidelines and Rubric.

START hilow_game

    # Establish a valid guessing range.
Prompt user for user for lower bound
Input lowerbound

Prompt user for upper bound
Input upperbound
WHILE lowerbound >= upperbound
    Display "Invalid range. Lower bound must be less than upper bound."

    Prompt user for lower bound
    Input lowerbound

    Prompt user for upper bound
    Input upperbound
END WHILE

    # Establish the number the player is trying to guess.
Generate randomNumber between lowerbound and upperbound

    # Play the game.
Prompt user to guess a number between lowerbound and upperbound
Input guess

WHILE guess < lowerbound OR guess > upperbound
    Display "Invalid guess. Please enter a number within the range."

    Prompt user to guess again
    Input guess
END WHILE

WHILE guess != randomNumber

    IF guess < randomNumber THEN
        Display "Too low! Try again."

    ELSE IF guess > randomNumber THEN
        Display "Too high! Try again."
END IF

    Prompt user to guess a number between lowerbound and upperbound
    Input guess
    WHILE guess < lowerbund OR guess > upperbound
        Display "Invalid guess. Please enter a number within the range."

        Prompt user to guess again
        Input guess
    END WHILE

END WHILE
 
Display "Congratulations! You guessed the correct number!"

END hilow_game

